  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This is a crazy idea, but I think it would change the game and legitimate vr musicians; \n\nA way to use midi out to control your daw from vrchat. \n\nOf course, one would have to stream their audio so people can hear what you're playing. \n\nBut, just imagine a bunch of faders, buttons, and stuff. All which can control your daw if configured correctly.",
